52. Draws attention to disclosures in the annual accounts of ERA and Eurojust regarding the implementation of SUMMA16 as the Commission’s financial platform seems to be badly malfunctioning; deplores the fact that, throughout 2023, technical issues continued to contribute to a rise in late payments (50 % in 2023) and instances of non-compliance in Eurojust; notes that ERA experienced technical issues during the first trimester, though substantial improvements were made in comparison with 2022;

---

16 New budgetary, accounting and financial system started as a pilot in 2022.
